    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Conerney Estate Agents are delighted to present to market this superb apartment, set within a well-established and highly convenient residential development.\r\nPresented in great condition throughout, this bright and spacious property offers comfortable, well-proportioned accommodation and would make an excellent home for first-time buyers, down-sizers or those seeking a quality property in a convenient location. This recently renovated property has been freshly painted throughout with new carpets installed in both bedrooms, and comes with an excellent 'B' energy rating, qualifying for Green mortgage rates.\r\nUpon entering the property, you are greeted by a bright entrance hallway with attractive timber flooring, providing access to the accommodation. The apartment enjoys excellent natural light throughout and a pleasant, spacious feel.\r\nThe bathroom is generously proportioned and finished with tiled flooring and tiled bath surround, comprising bath and shower, WC and wash hand basin.\r\nOne of the particularly attractive features of this development is its open setting and impressive outlook. Set behind secure gates with digital entry, secure assigned parking is also included. The surrounding green areas create a feeling of space rarely found in apartment developments.\r\nIts attractive low-rise design, together with the extensive green space surrounding the development, gives the property a considerably more open and peaceful feel than many modern apartment complexes.\r\nThe location is also extremely convenient, with a wide range of shops, schools, leisure facilities and other amenities within easy reach. Excellent transport connections provide convenient access to the surrounding areas and Dublin City Centre, while the nearby countryside and Dublin Mountains offer an abundance of recreational opportunities. Supermarkets and bus routes are just a stroll away and both the M50 and N81 are minutes away. The LUAS is also very close by, with the Square shopping centre just around the corner also.\r\nAll in all, this is a fabulous property. Set in a brilliant location in a much sought after area and boasting some excellent features, viewing of this property is strongly advised.\r\nIf you are interested in this property, please apply below, leave your name and number and we will contact you to arrange a viewing. Alternatively feel free to call on 01-4926004 for more info."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "A Fantastic Property in a Great location\r\n\r\nExcellent B Energy Rating \r\n\r\nGated Development\r\n\r\nSecure Assigned Parking Included\r\n\r\nFreshly Painted and New Carpets\r\n\r\nLarge open plan Living/ Sitting Area\r\n\r\nEn-Suite Master Bedroom\r\n\r\nQuality Built-in wardrobes"
      },
